{"id":"2034404037383210452","kind":"article","title":"演化的简单数学","author":"Rob Bensinger","original_authors":["Rob Bensinger"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/The-Simple-Math-Of-Evolution-Sequence"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2026-05-04","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":10,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":395,"keywords":["进化","自然选择","遗传历史","生物学","进化心理学"],"summary":"Rob Bensinger 将《演化的简单数学》定位为连接遗传历史、生物学现状与人类目标的章节，说明它需要超出自然选择入门层次的深入讨论；随后列出关于进化、优化和群体选择的小节。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2034404037383210452","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"qGs5WcDC\">《幽灵中的机器》的第一章<span class=\"nolink\">《演化的简单数学》</span>旨在传达我们的遗传历史、当下的生物学状态与终极追求之间的冲突与分歧。为此，我们需要进行比面向非生物学家的演化论入门更深入的探讨——那些入门通常只停留在自然选择的表象层面。</p><p data-pid=\"U2Jh_ib8\">—Rob Bensinger, <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Minds-An-Introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Minds: An Introduction</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><hr/><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4ccc597e964d0f9b0f2de61e9992b429.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"一位陌生的神祇\" data-tm-id=\"2017209895406035933\" href=\"#/post/2017209895406035933\">一位陌生的神祇</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-57ba5f184f4201f3525f92f6929f67ec.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"进化的奇迹\" data-tm-id=\"2017932223110735828\" href=\"#/post/2017932223110735828\">进化的奇迹</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0f96abf5f3ea6d173e93f1d1ac55ae88.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"进化很蠢（但确实有效）\" data-tm-id=\"2018382533511882216\" href=\"#/post/2018382533511882216\">进化很蠢（但确实有效）</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-f923ba2e63fcea5759490662a5258923.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;ne